  "_readme": [
      "Product catalog for scripts/populate-inventory.ts — matched to products by SKU (case-insensitive).",
      "null means 'not provided': on an existing product the current value is kept; on a new product the DB default (0) is used and the dry run flags it.",
      "openingStock is the counted stock BEFORE any recorded movement (products.brand_new); stock_quantity is then recomputed as openingStock + every approved stock movement, so it always agrees with the movement history.",
      "SKUs must match the code before ' / ' that installs and CP Systems use (e.g. '106' for '106 / MW) Oasis-S2'), or those records can't find the product.",
      "location is stored in the description as a 'Location: ...' line. The default location is the Quezon City Main Warehouse.",
      "Entries below the existing 16 come from data already in the app: Sale List models, CP System filter components, and unmapped install movements. They start at stock 0 and price 0 until real figures are entered."
